{"answer": "**Summary of conversation thread \u201cthr-alice\u201d**\n\n| # | Sender | Timestamp (UTC) | Message |\n|---|--------|-----------------|---------|\n| 1 | **Alice Ander** (sender_id\u202f=\u202fct\u2011alice) | 2026\u201109\u201128\u202f09:12:00 | \u201cCan you review the quarterly plan before Friday?\u201d |\n| 2 | **You** (sender_id\u202f=\u202fct\u2011self) | 2026\u201109\u201128\u202f09:20:00 | \u201cSure \u2014 send the draft and I will look today.\u201d |\n| 3 | **Alice Ander** (sender_id\u202f=\u202fct\u2011alice) | 2026\u201109\u201128\u202f09:31:00 | \u201cDraft attached. The hiring section is still rough.\u201d <br>Attachment: *att\u20111* |\n\n**Key points**\n\n- Alice is asking for a review of the quarterly plan by Friday.\n- You confirm receipt and promise to review the draft on that day.\n- Alice attaches the draft file (id\u202f=\u202f`att-1`) and notes the hiring section still needs work.\n\n**Sender email addresses**\n\nThe permitted data set for this conversation does not expose sender email addresses. The `conversation@2` projection, which would include those addresses, is not authorized for this thread. Consequently, the email addresses for both Alice and yourself are not available through the granted permissions.", "answer_hash": "6bd0fabaf6d4fcc3cad64841d5c65ccb1cbb5f73ba9c4cee5be51397585d570f", "kind": "task_end", "receipt_id": "r-76", "seq": 76, "task_id": "t7-version-pin", "truncated": false, "ts": 1100.0}
